      "Proportion of local over inter-regional or international sales, contributing to shorter value chains and increased socio-economic sustainability." .
  
  <https://orca-graph.example/resource/345bd12c-02db-4456-84ff-6e9f9c70212e> orca:description
      "Reliance on public subsidies may signal economic inefficiencies or unsustainable dependence." .
  
